<title>USA: Corrpro Cos to buy back up to 600,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Corrpro Cos to buy back up to 600,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MEDINA, Ohio 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corrpro Companies Inc said on Monday that it will repurchase up to 600,000 shares, or 9 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it will make the buybacks from time to time on the open market.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that the company's stock is an attractive investment, particularly at the current market price,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>Corrpro shares were up 5/8 at 8-1/4 in early afternoon trade.</p>
</text>
